{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Fish</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different types of fishing rods to catch a wide variety of fish, or buy a spearfishing gun and test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/57fc56b24b616d04292cfe46834542ed.poster.avif?t=1773910599\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/57fc56b24b616d04292cfe46834542ed.webm?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/57fc56b24b616d04292cfe46834542ed.mp4?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep It Afloat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boat is your main safety. Repair damage, change fuses, fix the engine, and help each other stay alive. No one can swim, but there is a buoy you can use in case of emergency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/16e3e7045f8dab1aa675e9bc57293d57.poster.avif?t=1773910599\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/16e3e7045f8dab1aa675e9bc57293d57.webm?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/16e3e7045f8dab1aa675e9bc57293d57.mp4?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sea Exploration &amp; Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail across dark and unpredictable waters. Discover abandoned structures, strange locations, and unfamiliar locals. You never know what you\u2019ll encounter out at sea.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.poster.avif?t=1773910599\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.webm?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.mp4?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to survive, coordinate tasks, and rescue crewmates in danger or make questionable decisions that put everyone at risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion is subjective. Customize your character with cosmetic and facial expression options, and unlock new hats through achievements while trying to survive each trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.poster.avif?t=1773910599\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.webm?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.mp4?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative multiplayer with proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fishing rods and spearfishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boat that can flood, break, and sink</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange fish, monsters, and local inhabitants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration with dynamic events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent debt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning and environmental danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror-lite atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather that affects visibility and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frogs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576880/d0dcfa620ab26a8a99b62d9629c170131e4e914b.jpg"},{"name":"Scout","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576880/6cfe19a92c4302f55f66f1841227706fe3a8dde9.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576880/15177b75481b31370085bfb739010595ff7a3985.jpg"},{"name":"New Recruit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576880/80b323712f6c4207241abfa1630ba12af230f3bd.jpg"},{"name":" Enginir","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576880/f1ba5bf7d22d43f276ae5fae7c153c4eecfc5ab9.jpg"},{"name":"Pro Swimmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576880/032a27cffbecf12ddcf1550787e6f93ebcfe9114.jpg"},{"name":"Blub blub blub","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576880/842c168643bed12df0dee0266ff4c7e6f17a264d.jpg"},{"name":"Boaty McBoatUpgrader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576880/bd04dbc60ba7d63bf44002fdbe82abf423bbdd72.jpg"},{"name":"Slimy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3576880/e1b38ce08eb8b61e8ce07c6a107c57d5278eca06.jpg"