9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/fe5fdbdd6de049ac6e484d9bc883ff31.mp4?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to survive, coordinate tasks, and rescue crewmates in danger or make questionable decisions that put everyone at risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fashion is subjective. Customize your character with cosmetic and facial expression options, and unlock new hats through achievements while trying to survive each trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.poster.avif?t=1773910599\" width=1170 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.webm?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576880/extras/c7315dc6d14b706865534541b440b70b.mp4?t=1773910599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative multiplayer with proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fishing rods and spearfishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boat that can flood, break, and sink</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange fish, monsters, and local inhabitants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration with dynamic events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades and progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persistent debt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowning and environmental danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror-lite atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather that af